+	// its only effect was to set FPCR, and nothing read FPCR in
+	// between. Overwrite it with A64 NOP (0xD503201F) and emit the
+	// new CFROUND in its place. This does NOT skip an msr fpcr when
+	// the rounding mode is merely unchanged at runtime: the mode is
+	// derived from a runtime register value, so a compile-time mode
+	// comparison is not available here, and a runtime mrs/cmp/branch
+	// guard would cost more than the rare CFROUND itself.
+	// Emission length: 4 words with rotation, 3 words without.
+	if (prevCFROUNDPos >= 0 && prevCFROUNDPos > prevFPPos && prevCFROUNDLen > 0)
